DeepInfer-SM86
==============

This repository is an unofficial SM86 backend extension for the DeepInfer
project. It is not an official DeepInfer release.

Portions of the source, model layout, naming and test structure are derived
from DeepInfer, which is distributed under the Apache License 2.0.

Original project:
https://gitee.com/mirrors/DeepInfer

The extension adds SM86-oriented Qwen2/Qwen2.5 W4A16, W3A16, GQA decode,
static KV-cache and CUDA Graph experiments. It does not claim to be a complete
DeepInfer engine implementation.

All derived code remains under the Apache License 2.0; see LICENSE.
